{"unit_id":"tag:08L6:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickening）。假设给定扩张（extensions）<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>，如（<REF_0001>）中所示，以及映射（maps）<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>。假设图（diagram）<MATH_0004>是交换（commutative）的。那么存在一个元素（element）<MATH_0005>，其消失（vanishing）是存在与<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>相容（compatible）的映射（map）<MATH_0006>的充要条件（necessary and sufficient condition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"增厚的空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给的一阶扩张。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"两个模扩张。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"给定的端项映射。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"所展示的方形。"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"该图的条件。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Ext 群的元素。"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失","context":"障碍类为零。"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容","context":"与给定映射相容。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"所求中间项映射。"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件","context":"障碍类的判据。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08L6:proof","translation":"我们可以显式构造一个扩张（extension）<MATH_0001>，方法是取<MATH_0002>为复形（complex）<MATH_0003>在中间的上同调（cohomology）（使用显然的记号）。利用引理的图（diagram）交换（commutes）的假设，通过局部截面（local sections）的计算可知<MATH_0004>被<MATH_0005>零化（annihilated）。因此<MATH_0006>定义了<MATH_0007>中的一个类（class）。最后，<MATH_0008>的类（class）是扩张（extension）<MATH_0009>经<MATH_0010>的推出（pushout）与扩张（extension）<MATH_0011>经<MATH_0012>的拉回（pullback）之差（计算略）。因此，<MATH_0013>的类（class）的消失（vanishing）等价（equivalent）于所需的交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0014>的存在。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"local sections","target_term":"局部截面"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"模的短正合列。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"构造中间模的复形。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"该复形中间的上同调。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"引理所给图。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"图的交换性。"},{"source_term":"local sections","target_term":"局部截面","context":"层的局部截面。"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化","context":"理想作用为零。"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"Ext 扩张类。"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出","context":"扩张沿映射的推出。"},{"source_term":"pullback",