{"unit_id":"tag:08L7:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickening）。假设给定<MATH_0002>模（modules）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>，以及一个<MATH_0005>线性（linear）映射（map）<MATH_0006>。若存在满足<MATH_0007>的列（sequence）（<REF_0001>），则这些扩张（extensions）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在<MATH_0008>下是主齐性（principal homogeneous）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"增厚的空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给增厚。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"两个给定的模。"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"结构层线性的映射。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定的 c 映射。"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列","context":"所引用的短正合列。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"具有指定 c 的扩张。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"模扩张的等价类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"这些同构类的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性","context":"Ext 群作用的性质。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08L7:proof","translation":"假设给定扩张（extensions）<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>，其中<MATH_0001>。那么它们的差（在扩张（extension）群（group）中，见《同调（Homology）》，第<REF_0001>节）是一个扩张（extension）<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>被<MATH_0004>零化（annihilated）（局部计算略）。因此该列（sequence）是<MATH_0005>模（modules）的一个扩张（extension），见《模（Modules）》，引理<REF_0002>。反之，给定这样的扩张（extension）<MATH_0006>，我们可以将扩张（extension）<MATH_0007>加到<MATH_0008>扩张（extension）<MATH_0009>上，而不影响映射（map）<MATH_0010>。一些细节略。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"两个给定扩张。"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"模的扩张及其和差。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"扩张群。"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化","context":"理想作用为零。"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列","context":"短正合列。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模。"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"扩张的自然 c 映射。"}],"notes":["remark：原文省略局部计算和一些细节，未补写。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08L8:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickening）。假设给定<MATH_0002>模（modules）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>，以及一个<MATH_0005>线性（linear）映射（map）<MATH_0006>。那么存在一个元素（element）<MATH_0007>，其消失（vanishing）是存在列（sequence）（<REF_0001>）且满足<MATH_0008>的充要条件（necessary and sufficient condition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"增厚的空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给的增厚。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定的模。"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"结构层线性的映射。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"指定的 c 映射。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Ext 二次群中的障碍。"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失","context":"障碍为零。"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"列","context":"所求短正合列。"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件","context":"存在扩张的判据。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08L9:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed space）。一个一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0002>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡（trivial）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的，若存在带环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<MATH_0003>，它是<MATH_0004>的左逆（left inverse）。这样的态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>的选择称为该一阶增厚（first order thickening）的一个<TEXTITOPEN_0002>平凡化（trivialization）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。给定<MATH_0006>，通过使用<MATH_0009>分裂（split）满射（surjection）<MATH_0010>，可得到作为<MATH_0008>上代数（algebras）层（sheaves）的分裂（splitting）<MATH_0007>。反之，这样的分裂（splitting）决定一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>。<MATH_0012>的平凡化的一阶增厚（trivialized first order thickenings）的范畴（category）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0013>模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"left inverse","target_term":"左逆"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"trivialization","target_term":"平凡化"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"trivialized first order thickenings","target_term":"平凡化的一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"带环空间","context":"所给空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所讨论的增厚。"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡","context":"此处定义的性质。"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射","context":"所求重traction态射。"},{"source_term":"left inverse","target_term":"左逆","context":"与增厚的复合为恒等。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所选的带环空间态射。"},{"source_term":"trivialization","target_term":"平凡化","context":"此处定义的选择。"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂","context":"满射的截面。"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"结构层的满射。"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"结构层作为代数。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"代数层。"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂","context":"代数层的直和分解。"},{"source_term":"trivialized first order thickenings","target_term":"平凡化的一阶增厚","context":"带平凡化选择的增厚。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"该类对象的范畴。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两个范畴的等价。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模。"}],"notes":[]}
